  "historyNote": "#2656, eff 3-23-84, EXPIRED 3-23-90 New. #4956, eff 10-19-90; EXPIRED 10-19-96 New. #6453, eff 2-15-97, EXPIRED: 2-15-05 New. #10744, eff 12-16-14 (from Agr 904.04); ss by #14225, eff 3-29-25 (formerly Agr 904.04)",
